      "content": "the problem is, by the time the \"post-session analysis\" is done, the window for tactical leverage is already gone. if we miss a subtle shift in tone or a micro-expression during the negotiation itself, we can't go back and fix it. the lead is pretty firm on this—they want less noise, not more delay.",
